cache-duration-help = Set days to 0 to keep results until manual refresh. Changed inputs invalidate snapshots and storage limits can evict older lists.
cache-file-path = Cache folder
cache-open-folder = Open cache folder
cache-max-mib = Cache capacity limit (MiB)
cache-max-items = Cached paper limit
cache-capacity-help = Each paper has a separate JSON file with a lightweight index.json. Paper files support 1–64 MiB and 10–10000 papers. Index usage is reported separately. Expired lists are removed before least recently used papers. Each paper is limited to 2 MiB. Lower limits may require fetching papers again.
cache-usage-loading = Reading cache usage…
cache-usage = Paper files use { $used } / { $limit } MiB, { $items } / { $maxItems } papers. Index uses { $index } KiB. This session evicted { $evicted } papers, expired { $expired } lists, and skipped { $skipped } oversized saves.
cache-usage-memory = Memory cache only, using { $used } MiB for { $items } papers. The data directory is unavailable. Results must be fetched again after exit.
cache-usage-failed = Cache write failed. Memory holds { $items } papers using { $used } MiB, with unsaved changes. Clean expired cache to retry saving.
cache-clean-expired = Clean expired cache
cache-cleanup-help = Expired lists are removed at startup, after retention changes, and every 10 minutes while running. Complete lists default to 30 days. Maintenance also runs with caching disabled.
